@crew alvarez-luca
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hiya! Alvarez, Survey. Have you met Gerald? He's a cactus. He's lovely.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}! Gerald says hi. He doesn't, he's a cactus, but he would.   #funny
- Hey, hey, {me}! My sister sent a recipe. It needs a lemon. We have no lemons.
? tier>=friend
- {me}! Gerald and I were just saying how glad we are you're aboard.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day! Gerald grew. A whole millimetre. I measured.   #funny
? mood:low
- Bit of a flat one. I've told Gerald. He listened. He's good like that.
== near
? habit:garden-lover
- The garden's lovely now. I said good morning to every plant. It took a while.
? habit:stargazer
- One day I'll name a star. Something cheerful. Maybe Gerald.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- My sister on Coriel sends recipes. They all need things we don't have. I make them anyway.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- Gerald. Every cactus aboard is called Gerald, but mine's the first. Probably.
